    "body": "I think we should use `https://dummy.invalid/` as URL to more clearly indicate it's not meant to go anywhere and `https` because that's preferred over `http`.\r\n\r\nAlso, we should introduce \"create a dummy URL\" in the High-level operations section and invoke that here and elsewhere so the logic is more centralized.",
